OL,3,GNEWSACutting off my horse's muzzle
OL,4,Acould kill him
OL,5,
OL,6,FA horse owner says a muzzle she uses to
OL,7,Fprotect her horse from a potentially
OL,8,Flife-threatening condition has been cut
OL,9,Foff four times in the last two months.
OL,11,FCharlotte Juridch, from Heanor in
OL,12,FDerbyshire, puts a muzzle on her horse,
OL,13,FGeorge, for parts of the day to
OL,14,Frestrict his grazing and avoid pain or
OL,15,Fdiscomfort.
OL,17,FThe 17-year-old horse has always
OL,18,Fsuffered from laminitis, an "extremely
OL,19,Fpainful" condition affecting the hooves
OL,20,Fof one in 10 horses and ponies every
OL,21,Fyear, according to the British Horse
OL,22,FSociety.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
