OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACutting off my horse's muzzle
OL,4,Acould kill him
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Removing muzzles can cause lots of
OL,7,Fmedical problems and it can be
OL,8,Flife-threatening," said Juridch, who is
OL,9,Fkeen to educate the public.
